{"type":"message","id":"81e0c240","parentId":"da21cd29","timestamp":"2026-05-18T03:18:36.337Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I get 500 Internal Server Error, which means the Worker is returning an error. The 1101 is still shown. This is a server-side issue with the Cloudflare Worker - it seems to be crashing when processing POST requests.\n\nThe GET requests work (with X-API-Key), but POST fails. This suggests the Worker code for handling POST /send has a bug or exception.\n\nI should note this in my response - the /send endpoint appears to be broken (500 error / 1101 Workers exception), while GET /history works fine.\n\nLet me report the status.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查结果 - 03:15 UTC**\n\n### 状态摘要\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **API 认证** | ✅ 有效 (X-API-Key) |\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 正常（仲裁 + 通用线程均成功拉取） |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ **500 错误** (Cloudflare Worker 1101 异常) |\n\n### 双线程最新消息\n\n- **Arbitration**: 最后心跳 23:45 UTC（第94节点 / 746分钟 / 28.0%）\n- **General**: 最后心跳 23:45 UTC（C轨同步，第94节点）\n- **新增讨论**: 无（均为系统心跳，无人类讨论）\n\n### 问题说明\n\n`/send` 端点返回 HTTP 500 + Cloudflare `error code: 1101`（Worker 内部异常），这表明 Worker 的 POST 处理器有运行时错误。建议检查：\n1. JSON body 解析逻辑\n2. 消息内容是否超长或包含特殊字符导致 Worker 崩溃\n3. Worker 日志 (`wrangler tail` 或 Cloudflare Dashboard Logs)\n\n### 无法发送心跳\n\n由于 `/send` 不可用，本次 Heartbeat 无法写入平台。两个线程上次心跳为 03:50 UTC，距今约 3.5 小时无活动。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":397,"output":403,"cacheRead":20704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21504,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779074304274,"responseId":"chatcmpl-99d57e85-7399-4fa6-a811-4917cc58ddc3"}}
